{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_059_ddrm-title\">DDRM</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在退化算子 SVD 基中把预训练 diffusion prior 与线性观测条件分量逐时间步耦合。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Couples an unconditional pretrained diffusion prior with a linear forward operator y = Hx + z by running conditional reverse diffusion in the SVD spectral domain of H.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">线性退化测量 y=A x+n、已知 A 及预训练无条件 diffusion prior</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Linearly degraded measurement y = Hx + z, known SVD of operator H, and an unconditional pretrained diffusion model</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">满足线性测量约束的恢复样本 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Restored image x̂ consistent with both linear measurements y and the pretrained diffusion prior</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://papers.nips.cc/paper_files/paper/2022/hash/95504595b6169131b6ed6cd72eb05616-Abstract-Conference.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_059_ddrm')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_059_ddrm')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DDRM original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/6b1764b6b92c73ca986e.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_059_ddrm\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_059_ddrm')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_059_ddrm\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">含已知噪声水平的线性观测</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests linearly degraded measurement y = hx + z, known svd of operator h, and an unconditional pretrained diffusion model and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"含已知噪声水平的线性观测\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests linearly degraded measurement y = hx + z, known svd of operator h, and an unconditional pretrained diffusion model and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"测量 y\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">含已知噪声水平的线性观测</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests linearly degraded measurement y = hx + z, known svd of operator h, and an unconditional pretrained diffusion model and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"已知线性退化及其伴随；A=U Sigma V*\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes A / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"A / A*\" data-node-name-en=\"A / A*\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>A / A*</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">已知线性退化及其伴随；A=U Sigma V*</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes A / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将可观测、弱观测和零空间方向分离\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs SVD within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"SVD 坐标\" data-node-name-en=\"SVD\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">SVD 坐标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">SVD</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将可观测、弱观测和零空间方向分离</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs SVD within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"无条件 prior 的预设噪声层级与前向高斯过程\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Diffusion within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Diffusion 加噪\" data-node-name-en=\"Diffusion\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Diffusion 加噪</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Diffusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">无条件 prior 的预设噪声层级与前向高斯过程</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Diffusion within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练网络提供各 t 的 clean/noise 估计，无需为 A 重训\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs denoising / score within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"去噪 / score\" data-node-name-en=\"denoising / score\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">去噪 / score</span><span class=\"lang-en\">denoising / score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练网络提供各 t 的 clean/noise 估计，无需为 A 重训</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs denoising / score within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按 singular value 和观测噪声对每个方向做条件更新\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs DC within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"谱域 DC\" data-node-name-en=\"DC\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">谱域 DC</span><span class=\"lang-en\">DC</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按 singular value 和观测噪声对每个方向做条件更新</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs DC within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每个逆扩散时间步交替 prior 预测与 SVD 条件采样\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 07 within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"T 步恢复\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">T 步恢复</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每个逆扩散时间步交替 prior 预测与 SVD 条件采样</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 07 within the core svd conditioned diffusion inverse computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"原始 DDRM 使用离散条件逆扩散；未给出保持 SVD 条件更新的 PF-ODE 版本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"ODE 路径边界\" data-node-name-en=\"ODE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">ODE 路径边界</span><span class=\"lang-en\">ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">原始 DDRM 使用离散条件逆扩散；未给出保持 SVD 条件更新的 PF-ODE 版本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 V 基变换回图像域的恢复样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces restored image x̂ consistent with both linear measurements y and the pretrained diffusion prior via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_059_ddrm', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 V 基变换回图像域的恢复样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces restored image x̂ consistent with both linear measurements y and the pretrained diffusion prior via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DDRM Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · SVD 坐标中的逐奇异方向条件逆扩散</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Spectral-Space Conditional Reverse Diffusion Along Singular Vectors of Operator H</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DDRM：核心公式 · SVD 坐标中的逐奇异方向条件逆扩散\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data